  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="9.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAtr">IV Atr</ref> 9.3</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="9.3" corresp="#wit-q">Et custodiant omnes monetam, sicut uos docere precipio et omnes elegimus.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="la" source="#robertson" n="9.3" corresp="#wit-q">Et custodiant omnes monetam, sicut vos docere praecipio et omnes elegimus.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-q">And the coinage is to be maintained by all at the standard which I lay down in your instructions, in accordance with the decision at which we have all arrived.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Und alle sollen die Münze so [aufrecht] halten, wie ich euch verordnen lasse und wie wir alle entschieden haben.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And let all maintain the coinage as I have had you instructed and as we have all decided.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
